# pop'n music 11, e-AMUSEMENT on (popn11-eamuse-on.his first, same --nvram, no card.bin yet): a whole
# credit with a new card ("D11 NEW CARD"). Coins, Start, the card in and red, the name (red x3:
# "あああ", blue left to 決定, red), the PIN 1234 twice; numbering, userdata.write, D11 player set
# and pf get; NORMAL, 9 buttons, songs played with a button every 10 frames, and at the credit's
# end D11 game select, userdata.write and D11 player set (mileage). About 46,000 frames.
#   hiraku-popn11 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn11-card-new.his
